WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.334 --> 00:00:15.333
Miss Gray: Wow . . . Great idea, Mark!

2
00:00:15.334 --> 00:00:19.375
Miss Gray: Boys and girls, please come to the rug.

3
00:00:19.376 --> 00:00:24.621
Miss Gray: Mark has something to tell you.

4
00:00:24.622 --> 00:00:27.001
Maya: Is it your birthday?

5
00:00:27.002 --> 00:00:29.338
Daisy: Did you get a new pet?

6
00:00:29.339 --> 00:00:32.339
Greg: I hope Mark's not moving.

7
00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:35.482
Mark: I was talking to my mom last night.

8
00:00:35.483 --> 00:00:38.749
Mark: She said that Jim's family needs help.

9
00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:41.628
Mark: We're his friends so—

10
00:00:41.629 --> 00:00:44.001
Daisy: We should help them!

11
00:00:44.002 --> 00:00:45.836
Mark: Right, Daisy.

12
00:00:45.837 --> 00:00:50.335
We can all help.

13
00:00:50.336 --> 00:00:52.538
Kara: But what can we do?

14
00:00:52.539 --> 00:00:55.186
Mark: Lots of things.

15
00:00:55.187 --> 00:01:08.309
I started making a list.

16
00:01:08.310 --> 00:01:11.432
Mark: Would you like to buy a cupcake, sir?

17
00:01:11.433 --> 00:01:14.020
Jenna: Or an apple pie?

18
00:01:14.021 --> 00:01:19.490
Daisy: Three cookies for one dollar!

19
00:01:19.491 --> 00:01:22.208
Man: Room Two Bake Sale?

20
00:01:22.209 --> 00:01:25.618
What's this about, kids?

21
00:01:25.619 --> 00:01:29.196
Daisy: We're raising money to help our friend.

22
00:01:29.197 --> 00:01:32.532
Mark: A tree fell on his house.

23
00:01:32.533 --> 00:01:37.481
Coby: Yeah. And everything got ruined!

24
00:01:37.482 --> 00:01:40.535
Maya and Eve: Car wash here!

25
00:01:40.536 --> 00:01:43.296
Ted: Get your car washed!

26
00:01:43.297 --> 00:01:49.651
Greg: Just two dollars to make your car sparkle!

27
00:01:49.652 --> 00:02:06.524
Woman: Here's five dollars, kids.

28
00:02:06.525 --> 00:02:11.921
Man: Here's ten dollars!

29
00:02:11.922 --> 00:02:22.067
Kids: Thank you!

30
00:02:22.068 --> 00:02:26.885
Mr. Miller: And now, boys and girls, I have an important announcement.

31
00:02:26.886 --> 00:02:30.685
Mr. Miller: Room Two is collecting clothing this week.

32
00:02:30.686 --> 00:02:33.939
Mr. Miller: The clothes are for Jim and his family.

33
00:02:33.940 --> 00:02:43.544
Mr. Miller: Please help if you can.

34
00:02:43.545 --> 00:02:45.887
Coby: This is so great.

35
00:02:45.888 --> 00:02:47.373
Mark: I know.

36
00:02:47.374 --> 00:02:52.010
The whole school is working together to help Jim!
